{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":18,"ref":"2-chronicles 25:18","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":25,"translation":"Und Joasch, der König von Jisra'el, sandte zu Amazja, dem König von Jehuda, und ⟨ließ⟩ sagen: „Der Disteldorn, der im Libanon ⟨steht⟩, sandte zu der Zeder, die im Libanon ⟨steht⟩, und ⟨ließ⟩ sagen: ‚Gib ⟨את⟩ deine Tochter meinem Sohn zur Frau!' Da zog ein Wildtier des Feldes, das im Libanon ⟨war⟩, vorbei und zertrat ⟨את⟩ den Disteldorn.","tokens":[{"surface":"וישלח","gloss":"Und er sandte"},{"surface":"יואש","gloss":"Joasch"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"König"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"von Jisra'el"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"zu"},{"surface":"אמציהו","gloss":"Amazja"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"König"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"von Jehuda"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"und ⟨ließ⟩ sagen"},{"surface":"החוח","gloss":"Der Disteldorn"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"der"},{"surface":"בלבנון","gloss":"im Libanon"},{"surface":"שלח","gloss":"sandte"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"zu"},{"surface":"הארז","gloss":"der Zeder"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"die"},{"surface":"בלבנון","gloss":"im Libanon"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"und ⟨ließ⟩ sagen"},{"surface":"תנה","gloss":"Gib"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"deine Tochter"},{"surface":"בתך","gloss":"deine Tochter"},{"surface":"לבני","gloss":"meinem Sohn"},{"surface":"לאשה","gloss":"zur Frau"},{"surface":"ותעבר","gloss":"da zog … vorbei"},{"surface":"חית","gloss":"ein Wildtier"},{"surface":"השדה","gloss":"des Feldes"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"das"},{"surface":"בלבנון","gloss":"im Libanon"},{"surface":"ותרמס","gloss":"und zertrat"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"den Disteldorn"},{"surface":"החוח","gloss":"den Disteldorn"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:59:54.846167139Z","model":"glm-5.2"}